# Keep line endings deterministic. The launchers are the reason this matters:
# start-mac-linux.command needs LF or macOS rejects its shebang, and
# start-windows.bat needs CRLF or older cmd.exe mis-reads it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
